# Cross-device sessions (Supabase Realtime). Git-ignored via .env* in .gitignore.
#
# Leave EMPTY -> rooms run over BroadcastChannel: other tabs in this browser only,
# with a banner in the room saying so. The app works fine in that state.
#
# Fill in to reach a second device. Supabase -> Project Settings -> API:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL       the "Project URL"
#     e.g. https://abcdefghijklm.supabase.co
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY  the "anon" / "public" key (a long JWT)
#     e.g. eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3Mi...
#
# Use the anon/publishable key, never service_role/secret. Both vars are
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ and are sent to the browser.
#
# Restart `npm run dev` after editing -- env vars are read at startup only.
# Full walkthrough: docs/setup.md

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_LOCAL_TRANSPORT=